 r←Test_Menubar_001(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;TheForm;md;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with a complex and valid definition
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Menubar.CreateParms
 'TheForm'⎕WC'Form'('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(35 45))('Size'(300 400))
 'SB'TheForm.⎕WC'Statusbar'
 'F1'TheForm.SB.⎕WC'StatusField'('Coord' 'Prop')('Size'(⍬ 99))
 'TheForm'⎕WS'Hintobj'TheForm.SB.F1
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Menubar.Create TheForm MenuSample parms(⎕NEW #.APLGUI.APLGUI.KeyCodes)
 md←∆InterpretMenuDef MenuSample
 →PassesIf 9∧.={↑n.⎕NC ⍵}¨md
 n.cut.Active←0
 n.copy.Checked←1
 n.helpMenu.Active←0

 r←∆OK
